2026-07-27T10:29:21.3506924Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3507708Z i /tmp/RtmpaVaPuV/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3508539Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3509161Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3509702Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3510915Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3512145Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:29:21.3513540Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
